765	  /* e) Parabolic interpolation: fit parabola to (d*-1, d*, d*+1)
766	   *    τ = d* + (corr[d*-1] - corr[d*+1]) / (2 * (corr[d*-1] - 2*corr[d*] + corr[d*+1]))
